## Import

Import a branch-local schedule or storage trigger using `<project_id>/<branch_id>/<trigger_id>`.
Use literal identifiers, without URL encoding, query or fragment delimiters, or dot segments.

```shell
terraform import neon_trigger.example "project-id/branch-id/trigger-id"
```

Inherited triggers cannot be imported because updating them creates branch-local shadows and deleting them creates tombstones.
